  "canon:pmid": "1280054",
  "canon:title": "Fatal myeloencephalopathy due to intrathecal vincristine administration.",
  "canon:abstract": "Vincristine was accidentally given intrathecally to a child with leukaemia, producing sensory and motor dysfunction followed by encephalopathy and death. Separate times for administering vincristine and intrathecal therapy is recommended.",
  "canon:text": "Fatal myeloencephalopathy due to intrathecal vincristine administration. Vincristine was accidentally given intrathecally to a child with leukaemia, producing sensory and motor dysfunction followed by encephalopathy and death. Separate times for administering vincristine and intrathecal therapy is recommended.",
